            <div xml:id="m-21048af5-3ec9-4141-8f9c-59a7e9f48b7b">
              <lg xml:id="m-0769d83b-6ee4-432a-873d-c6f1921c2e9f">
                <l xml:id="m-7a4c2943-5e74-41c9-8578-be98be133c22" facs="#m-24ae08fb-e49c-46f0-b8fa-abc44c58b638" label="ambiguous">828</l><l xml:id="m-6fc8f7b7-f820-42f7-aa11-6a68b3f4ef58" facs="#m-e0a10d21-4161-413f-a89e-a62d0f99fe26" label="text-like">ath Sunday after Easter.</l><l xml:id="m-88f7fecb-39ec-4363-97c2-064ccedf3c1e" facs="#m-6e4d8ca7-2afe-4bfd-893f-76a67683dcd8" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. 16.</l><l xml:id="m-ab53bdb7-2ceb-4d41-bad0-0356f82037f4" facs="#m-9ffe33d8-f27f-4614-b60d-83411baeeb4e" label="lyrics-like">FN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus di-lvero, quia ad Patrem vado, et jam</l><l xml:id="m-38fe6d82-3943-4dc7-8dc4-e7ba0b6818ca" facs="#m-0a0db541-009c-41ec-9b99-247cf0ebd354" label="lyrics-like">L scípulis suis: Vado ad eum qui</l><l xml:id="m-4f78bfdd-c601-475c-9f32-f509e1428746" facs="#m-ad53624a-3b2a-4996-948e-dd94114908ad" label="lyrics-like">non vidébitis me: de judicio autem,</l><l xml:id="m-c6f41910-83cc-4db3-a808-748eba29ddba" facs="#m-f639805b-3bdc-41db-bd52-4a69846e1343" label="ambiguous">quia princeps hujus mundi jam</l><l xml:id="m-cfb8f76a-8c90-4df7-b474-0b4fe2fd4926" facs="#m-95e921c9-45cf-4584-aa58-6fe37478ffb7" label="lyrics-like">misit me: et nemo ex vobis intèr¬</l><l xml:id="m-59bca305-6037-4b32-8ce0-6f234f4c9864" facs="#m-be36d278-ff6f-4d84-a40c-6ecdcc5abc0d" label="lyrics-like">judicátus est. Adhuc multa hábeo</l><l xml:id="m-821a0f7d-1475-477b-848c-be90ed5da652" facs="#m-8f9fd582-5815-46f9-ad7d-6c806229070c" label="ambiguous">rogat me: Quo vadis? Sed quia</l><l xml:id="m-280417fd-9092-463a-9989-59ac1708e81c" facs="#m-abb6ca93-a1dc-451d-858a-84c43cedde8f" label="lyrics-like">vobis dicere: sed non potéstis por¬</l><l xml:id="m-1796020e-3696-4c68-9582-645fc764c2b1" facs="#m-08a2748d-7c05-43d7-84b9-25a44e0698fd" label="lyrics-like">haec locútus sum vobis, tristitia</l><l xml:id="m-34c07989-cc6b-4ecd-bde4-1962782b9e37" facs="#m-2ca67206-08eb-4c76-b3fd-39f232af4d38" label="lyrics-like">táre modo. Cum autem vénerit ille</l><l xml:id="m-98d7c7bb-dece-400f-a6a0-05b7a025b3ef" facs="#m-d09faf5b-20ba-4644-a32f-cb4ddc83d660" label="lyrics-like">implévit cor vestrum. Sed ego ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-c8a9b849-5925-4fe3-a249-b859022baa27" facs="#m-af5d6e6a-b44e-48d8-b3de-b43d28aaa784" label="lyrics-like">ritátem dico vobis: éxpedit vobis</l><l xml:id="m-15dcfc5b-adec-437c-9699-c284c7511022" facs="#m-0528c0ea-f269-4c03-8571-706db021fa97" label="lyrics-like">Spíritus veritátis, docébit vos omnem</l><l xml:id="m-71618ac5-98aa-4c90-8b12-f5386fe59d09" facs="#m-5515c67e-eae6-4f51-aba2-38c3d55d81ea" label="lyrics-like">veritátem. Non enim loquétur a</l><l xml:id="m-45c148f5-e848-4ee2-841d-109119618104" facs="#m-6333e78d-2abd-4443-8e83-1e3713ac91d5" label="lyrics-like">ut ego vadam: si enim non abíero,</l><l xml:id="m-f696a750-140e-4645-82e6-eded39545d63" facs="#m-1d809d68-6a3e-467b-830b-d110e4acf449" label="lyrics-like">Paráclitus non véniet ad vos: si</l><l xml:id="m-baa985e5-536d-4949-8e02-007738546489" facs="#m-03ce14ef-ebb6-4962-8bef-0660c9c814cf" label="lyrics-like">semetipso: sed quaecúmque audiet,</l><l xml:id="m-5a2d0756-0cf4-477d-a059-721e5183c8ab" facs="#m-0ff2b84d-3d60-4ff8-91d5-bbcced49bb6b" label="lyrics-like">loquétur, et quae venturã sunt, an¬</l><l xml:id="m-2afb617f-bc24-4851-bf81-6a600e613f69" facs="#m-b501c534-8595-41fd-b24d-c0582406d18f" label="ambiguous">autem abiero, mittam eum ad vos.</l><l xml:id="m-2a33efb2-ed8f-4da3-be8e-fec106a3b4e4" facs="#m-dc4ffff1-122a-4a54-9bfd-25418ab5284e" label="lyrics-like">nuntiábit vobis. Ille me clarificábit :</l><l xml:id="m-edb12b0b-669a-49e7-9efc-6986c230e44a" facs="#m-86a2d6b1-54b8-44c2-a26b-e91352ca45aa" label="lyrics-like">Et cum vénerit ille, árguet mun¬</l><l xml:id="m-f88cb506-a0a1-4973-84ed-1ce9eade93ce" facs="#m-12f77870-4d67-45e8-9315-49501d64905e" label="lyrics-like">quia de meo accípiet, et annuntiá¬</l><l xml:id="m-2638a826-9702-4503-924b-914c852055f7" facs="#m-cf2c6b60-13be-45eb-8c5c-6db86f243213" label="lyrics-like">dum de peccáto, et de justitia, et</l><l xml:id="m-fdc74a18-bf31-411f-81c6-489689fd7b11" facs="#m-f34f928c-31f5-4ea2-91be-6de073e4ba43" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-f752ee8a-d378-44c9-a7ec-f2ac7c674623" facs="#m-1ae4914c-5947-4327-8cec-fe3c58a62e38" label="lyrics-like">de judicio. De peccáto quidem, quia</l><l xml:id="m-7b50e74b-10f8-4f39-a837-c4d880713bf2" facs="#m-551034cf-3a27-4210-9633-1836815b8574" label="ambiguous">bit vobis.</l><l xml:id="m-dfd28eef-8033-4c9c-bd45-604965528b38" facs="#m-342b181f-be22-44ea-9b13-2e31db21e6b0" label="lyrics-like">non credidérunt in me: de justitia</l><l xml:id="m-f8558c97-ed44-403b-89ce-1507b5c66077" facs="#m-6e4d5bd4-3ac9-4c1d-b426-36f3e3ff79e8" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Jubiláte Déo. p. 486.</l><l xml:id="m-825e777a-fd0f-4a39-8c4b-449a316cac12" facs="#m-9fa69c36-5a77-42fa-9076-a1d7158633f6" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-ef154e47-7943-492c-a4b4-de68b328e95c" facs="#m-7acdd43a-b6ec-4b72-83d1-b0f3f28441ee" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui nos per hujus sacrificii tuam cognóscimus veritátem, sic</l><l xml:id="m-68ca8cf5-cf4e-41e1-9594-9d0b33866143" facs="#m-5588c72c-76fa-416f-973f-0ff3526bfe97" label="lyrics-like">A veneránda commércia, únius</l><l xml:id="m-d2dffe6f-e3f5-441e-b51c-e7b9dc4bacfb" facs="#m-dadfa59a-3fb8-4b87-9fac-2065faf77958" label="lyrics-like">eam dignis móribus asequámur.</l><l xml:id="m-8e74beab-9cd4-41d2-bf3e-e286cce5e9cf" facs="#m-96636dc0-502b-460c-afba-741791acfa0b" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-8abc3bb6-21ed-459e-91e4-70c38e060348" facs="#m-12ec0f32-5457-44dd-b7c9-a688e5641fe7" label="lyrics-like">summae divinitátis participes effe¬</l><l xml:id="m-687d6acd-b448-4b86-bda0-aa7c9cff2a75" facs="#m-637408c8-ce6b-487e-acca-080a2c90d9d3" label="lyrics-like">cisti; praesta, quaésumus : ut, sicut!</l><l xml:id="m-35078b87-5ce7-4466-bc3d-bd1ce705d92d" facs="#m-3a54b20a-ec50-4a46-af4d-942f114dd27c" label="text-like">2. Of Our Lady, p. 819. — 8. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 322.</l><l xml:id="m-de087617-ce84-444e-a4db-b79525d1a456" facs="#m-76ed50d4-df17-4709-aea5-d784eee39862" label="text-like">Preface. Easter Sunday, p. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-97e9b3ac-fddb-4d46-892e-b38e8e75fa87" facs="#m-7ded123a-4034-407a-ad69-ae95be332d03" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-5e1dd381-19a3-4d86-951e-be560c47ed08" facs="#m-a43cadf1-3299-490c-b4e1-d0b7bd314e63" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-964d543e-9e60-40e4-bbf7-cdc2a52929e7" facs="#m-2d9d4c57-07db-4511-858b-4c5672ce3b46" label="lyrics-like">DUM vé-ne¬ rit “Pa-rá-cli-tus</l><l xml:id="m-04c0dad1-5f79-4c7d-902b-281d7eba20f8" facs="#m-c1421772-d429-472a-bc9b-5dcaff4a828b" label="lyrics-like">Spí-ri-tus ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a2a8b43-4d20-490a-8b7d-1999a68d6221" facs="#m-f66934e8-c463-4afa-8c58-f6d5f8de100e" label="lyrics-like">ri-tá- tis, ille ár-gu-et múndum de peccá¬ to, et</l><l xml:id="m-adab926c-4cfb-48c7-a433-007522dbafcb" facs="#m-10bf5e2f-31d5-4235-a434-30301f3ffe06" label="lyrics-like">de ju-stí-ti-a et de judí-ci¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f5d5b32-20c7-4a00-b62d-fc3d8841778d" facs="#m-417750c0-8672-46cc-ba2c-e34e2de70e5b" label="lyrics-like">alle- lú- ia, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-2224a723-d715-4663-aa4f-2178f0d8288a" facs="#m-82abc5ab-1eb1-4294-b45b-9708dcfaba83" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-bb64c07a-b70c-4880-acd3-a8f8e298e58f" facs="#m-96a76e68-f502-4f2a-b095-2edeaf7ea0c7" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-af24dc56-5962-4530-9e4a-f53e901c0f16" facs="#m-78dd4dee-a543-464d-bf28-bbc2a1edeada" label="lyrics-like">I Désto nobis, Dómine Deus no-l a perículis ómnibus eruámur. Per</l><l xml:id="m-dd56280c-9c9e-4716-9e2c-008474d1558f" facs="#m-cc9e2b9e-f4dd-4655-ae6f-a9cdb191b9a5" label="lyrics-like">Aster :ut per haec, quae fidéliter</l><l xml:id="m-dff0c52e-cf53-4b36-932f-bc192a598443" facs="#m-95f692db-d46e-4298-be6d-13149b7d2f92" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-cbae10aa-6e53-43f5-b0fd-e0f4c1d7477d" facs="#m-0b261f62-dfce-440f-801f-45d3e27fbd05" label="lyrics-like">sómpsimus, et purgémur a vítiis, et</l><l xml:id="m-4643d04f-2c2b-4d81-bb6c-63eff549c15c" facs="#m-40597b2b-ef70-4e41-af07-2eedd7a9e5a2" label="text-like">2. Of Our Lady, p. 819. — 8. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 823.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>